  "body": "Beach walks before breakfast, coffee with friends, dinner out without the drive home, or a sunny afternoon on the deck. This four bedroom, two and a half bathroom home, with two huge lounges and ample parking, makes it easy to enjoy the coastal holiday lifestyle every day.\r\nTucked away from the road along a palm-lined driveway, this beautifully maintained property welcomes you with light-filled spaces, a relaxed atmosphere and room for family life to evolve.\r\nVaulted ceilings give the spacious lounge an airy sense of volume, with a corridor outlook across the harbour to the city. The north-facing kitchen, dining and family areas bring everyone together, while doors open to an east- and north-facing sundeck for outdoor dining, relaxed get-togethers and long summer evenings.\r\nWith approximately 230 sqm of floor area, there’s plenty of room to spread out. Three downstairs bedrooms sit apart from the generous upstairs master suite, which spans the western end of the home and has windows on three sides, a walk-in robe and its own bathroom. All four bedrooms enjoy northern light.\r\nThe wraparound garden is attractively planted and easy to maintain, with no lawns to mow. There’s more time for beach days, coastal walks and exploring the East Coast Bays - and less time spent on garden upkeep. The tucked-away setting adds a welcome sense of privacy.\r\nA double internal-access garage, three off-street parks and generous storage make everyday life easier. \r\nThe home is comfortable as it stands, with scope to personalise the décor or explore additional outdoor features to suit your lifestyle.\r\nWith a choice of beaches, coastal parks, a boat ramp and free public BBQ facilities nearby, there’s plenty to enjoy close to home. The beach is approximately 850 metres away, with local shops, cafés, evening venues and bus connections also within reach. Enjoy dinner and drinks locally, then simply walk home.\r\nLove the idea of coastal living every day? Come and discover it for yourself.\r\nCall Shane now to arrange a viewing or for further details",
